# Orderly Web — environment configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and uncomment / edit the values that
# differ from your local backend setup. `.env.local` is gitignored.
#
# No secrets live here. The refresh token is an httpOnly cookie set
# by the Identity Service and is never visible to JS. Per
# AGENTS.md §Security, the only JWT exposed to the frontend is the
# short-lived (15-minute) access token, held in Redux memory only.

# YARP API Gateway base URL. The frontend never reaches upstream
# service ports directly — every RTK Query slice appends its service
# path prefix (e.g. /identity-api, /catalog-api, /order-api,
# /kitchen-api, /basket-api, /discount-api, /notification-api).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:6004

# SignalR hub URL. The default carries the upstream /kitchen-api
# prefix; the signalr.ts factory appends only /hubs/kitchen.
# Example: http://localhost:6004/kitchen-api/hubs/kitchen
# VITE_SIGNALR_URL=http://localhost:6004/kitchen-api

# Optional: gate non-prod logging.
# VITE_NODE_ENV=development